{"metadata":{"description":"Evidence-first model control plane for DeepSeek Harness","id":"gh:1333446160","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-switch","slug":"dongsheng123132/dsh-switch","topics":["2origin","ai-agent","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","model-routing","provider-health"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Evidence-first model control plane for DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-switch"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**Maintainer / Author：He Fangsheng (贺方升 / 贺去病; also known as Dosen) · hequbing.com**"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"> Evidence-first model control plane for DeepSeek Harness."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"中文"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"`dsh-switch` does two deliberately separate jobs:"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"1. The DSH bundle exposes model-facing tools that inspect registered provider routes, validate an ex"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"act provider/model through the official `ctx.llm` seam, and save the default for **new sessions** th"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"rough `ctx.agentDefaultModel`.
2. The standalone CLI probes OpenAI-compatible `/models` endpoints an"},{"id":"p7s4","text":"d reports reachability, HTTP status, latency, model count, and whether a credential environment vari"},{"id":"p7s5","text":"ity, HTTP status, latency, model count, and whether a credential environment variable is configured."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"It does not intercept model requests, implement another OpenAI adapter, or silently reroute an activ"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"e session. Projects such as `dsh-polyglot` and `dsh-llm-fallbacks` own adapter/fallback behavior; th"},{"id":"p8s3","text":"is project is the observable control plane around routes DSH already knows."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## Install the DSH bundle"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"Pin a reviewed commit when installing from GitHub:"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"The bundle ships JavaScript and has no install/build lifecycle script."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"### Tools"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"`dsh_switch_status({ includeModels? })`"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"- shows the default selection used by newly created sessions;
- lists registered provider routes;
- "},{"id":"p15s2","text":"optionally asks each adapter for its advertised models;
- performs no provider network health reques"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"y asks each adapter for its advertised models;
- performs no provider network health request itself."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"`dsh_switch_default({ provider, model, reasoningEffort?, expectedProvider?, expectedModel? })`"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"- validates the exact route with `ctx.llm.resolveModelInfo()`;
- rejects an unsupported reasoning ef"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"fort;
- supports an optimistic-concurrency expectation pair;
- saves through `ctx.agentDefaultModel."},{"id":"p17s3","text":"saveSelection()`;
- reads the value back and fails if the write is not observable;
- affects new ses"},{"id":"p17s4","text":"sions only. Existing sessions keep the route recorded in their logs."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## Probe provider endpoints"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Copy `providers.example.json` to a private local file such as `providers.json`. Reference secrets by"},{"id":"p19s2","text":" environment-variable name—never place keys in JSON."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"JSON output:"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"Example output:"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"The probe sends `GET <baseURL><modelsPath>`. It does not send a chat completion and therefore does n"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"ot consume inference tokens. A successful `/models` response proves endpoint reachability, not end-t"},{"id":"p25s3","text":"o-end generation correctness."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## Security and evidence boundaries"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"- `apiKey` fields and credentials embedded in URLs are rejected.
- Output contains only `configured`"},{"id":"p27s2","text":", `missing`, or `not-required`; secret values never enter results.
- A 401/403 endpoint is reachable"},{"id":"p27s3","text":" but not healthy.
- DSH tool switching validates registered adapter metadata, not live provider I/O."},{"id":"p27s4","text":"
- No automatic fallback or cost-based routing is enabled in v0.1."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"The plugin smoke test requires the official DSH runtime packages to be resolvable:"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"MIT © 2026 hfshfg"}],"truncated":false}
